  "topic": "Reshaping",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "prompt": "Turn col1, col2, col3 and col4 into separate rows in one column named col. Keep duplicates. These inputs contain non-null strings. Commas inside strings remain unchanged; do not add an extra blank row (the upstream printed table had a stray blank).",
